{"messages":[{"text":"🇺🇦 Trump insta a Zelenski a dejar de atacar la industria petrolera rusa, en pleno pulso por la guerra y la energía.\n🌶️ Trump quiere paz, pero con la gasolinera de Putin fuera del menú.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Trump%20insta%20a%20Zelenski%20a%20dejar%20de%20atacar%20la%20industria%20petrolera%20rusa%2C%20en%20pleno%20pulso%20por%20la%20guerra%20y%20la%20energ%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Trump%20quiere%20paz%2C%20pero%20con%20la%20gasolinera%20de%20Putin%20fuera%20del%20men%C3%BA."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Trump%20insta%20a%20Zelenski%20a%20dejar%20de%20atacar%20la%20industria%20petrolera%20rusa%2C%20en%20pleno%20pulso%20por%20la%20guerra%20y%20la%20energ%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20La%20diplomacia%20de%20Trump%20vuelve%20a%20venir%20con%20instrucciones%20sobre%20d%C3%B3nde%20s%C3%AD%20se%20puede%20disparar."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Trump%20insta%20a%20Zelenski%20a%20dejar%20de%20atacar%20la%20industria%20petrolera%20rusa%2C%20en%20pleno%20pulso%20por%20la%20guerra%20y%20la%20energ%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Para%20Trump%2C%20la%20l%C3%ADnea%20roja%20de%20la%20guerra%20parece%20cotizar%20en%20barriles."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%A6%20Trump%20insta%20a%20Zelenski%20a%20dejar%20de%20atacar%20la%20industria%20petrolera%20rusa%2C%20en%20pleno%20pulso%20por%20la%20guerra%20y%20la%20energ%C3%ADa.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Zelenski%20recibe%20otro%20mapa%20de%20objetivos%2C%20esta%20vez%20dibujado%20desde%20Washington."}],"search_terms":["Trump","Zelenski","Rusia"]},{"text":"⚖️ La fiscal jefa Antidroga, Rosa Ana Morán, reclama juzgados especializados ante el problema «estructural» del narcotráfico en Andalucía.\n🌶️ Cuando la Fiscal