]},{"text":"🔥 Emergencias envía un ES-Alert a Benahavís (Málaga) y mantiene confinamientos preventivos por la evolución del incendio forestal.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%94%A5%20Emergencias%20env%C3%ADa%20un%20ES-Alert%20a%20Benahav%C3%ADs%20%28M%C3%A1laga%29%20y%20mantiene%20confinamientos%20preventivos%20por%20la%20evoluci%C3%B3n%20del%20incendio%20forestal."}],"search_terms":["Benahavís","incendio","ES-Alert"]},{"text":"🏎️ Las 11 activistas de Greenpeace detenidas durante una protesta junto al circuito de F1 de Madrid han quedado en libertad.\n🌶️ Madring estrena circuito y también su propia vuelta rápida por comisaría.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%8E%EF%B8%8F%20Las%2011%20activistas%20de%20Greenpeace%20detenidas%20durante%20una%20protesta%20junto%20al%20circuito%20de%20F1%20de%20Madrid%20han%20quedado%20en%20libertad.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Madring%20estrena%20circuito%20y%20tambi%C3%A9n%20su%20propia%20vuelta%20r%C3%A1pida%20por%20comisar%C3%ADa."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%8E%EF%B8%8F%20Las%2011%20activistas%20de%20Greenpeace%20detenidas%20durante%20una%20protesta%20junto%20al%20circuito%20de%20F1%20de%20Madrid%20han%20quedado%20en%20libertad.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20La%20F1%20promet%C3%ADa%20espect%C3%A1culo%3B%20Greenpeace%20a%C3%B1adi%C3%B3%20una%20parada%20en%20boxes%20policial."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%8E%EF%B8%8F%20Las%2011%20activistas%20de%20Greenpeace%20detenidas%20durante%20una%20protesta%20junto%20al%20circuito%20de%20F1%20de%20Madrid%20han%20quedado%20en%20libertad.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20circuito%20ya%20tiene%20chicanes%2C%20pol%C3%A9mica%20y%20detenidas%3A%20el%20pack%20madrile%C3%B1o%20ven%C3%ADa%20completo."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%8F%8E%EF%B